ounter","required_flex_slots":null,"sell_priority":null,"imbue_target_ability_id":null}],"optional":null},{"name":"Extension (Spirit)","width":1033,"height":164,"description":"Damage goes up. (Imbue Cooldown on Hook, Everything else on Bomb)","mods":[{"ability_id":380806748,"annotation":"Must have, no comments","required_flex_slots":null,"sell_priority":null,"imbue_target_ability_id":null},{"ability_id":2121044373,"annotation":"Puts way more damage into your first bomba. Very decent buff","required_flex_slots":null,"sell_priority":null,"imbue_target_ability_id":null},{"ability_id":1193964439,"annotation":"It makes the explosion bigger. As of recent changes might be a nice idea to imbue the hook, as it got nerfed in distance","required_flex_slots":null,"sell_priority":null,"imbue_target_ability_id":null},{"ability_id":7409189,"annotation":"Plain upgrade","required_flex_slots":null,"sell_priority":null,"imbue_target_ability_id":null},{"ability_id":3261353684,"annotation":"Make hooks and bombas go every second","required_flex_slots":null,"sell_priority":null,"imbue_target_ability_id":null},{"ability_id":3612042342,"annotation":"Nice speed buff as well as your biggest damage spike","required_flex_slots":null,"sell_priority":null,"imbue_target_ability_id":null},{"ability_id":1292979587,"annotation":"Imbue on bomba for even more damage. However, this item is pretty optional as build becomes very expensive at this point","required_flex_slots":null,"sell_priority":null,"imbue_target_ability_id":null},{"ability_id":869090587,"annotation":"Wait... What? Triple bomba?","required_flex_slots":null,"sell_priority":null,"imbue_target_ability_id":null},{"ability_id":1144549437,"annotation":"You can buy this as soon as you run out of flex slots","required_flex_slots":null,"sell_priority":null,"imbue_target_ability_id":null}],"optional":null},{"name":"Extension (Vitality)","width":1049,"height":202,"description":"Survavability goes up  (Select bullet/spirit armour and it's upgraded v